WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.459
Oh my God, he will
 not let it go.

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:03.169
You can tell he's Latin,

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.754
because Latin people are tenacious. 

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.344
My name is Nick Barili,
 and I'm traveling the country

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.471
to sit down with some of
the biggest Latinx artists

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.931
in places that have
meaning to them 

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:16.057
and help tell their stories.

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:16.808
Hello, hello.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:17.642
How are you doing?

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:20.395
This particular building
 is the Chicano studies

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:22.522
It’s a pretty special
place for me.

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:24.357
We'll talk about their
journeys and careers 

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.109
and explore issues of identity, 

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:28.695
culture, discrimination
 and representation.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.488
I got scars in my head

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.698
from hitting that glass ceiling. 

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:35.285
Trying to understand
 your culture and your heritage

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:37.120
and the roots
that make you

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.663
the human being
that you are,

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:41.207
sharing it so that
others can understand it,

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.001
makes everybody stronger. 

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:46.296
This is Seen.

